| Score decomposition: `set_score_decomposition` in `src/mcrl/physics_v025/targets.py` | Returned a constant zero/empty `SetScoreDecomposition`. | v1.5 exact decomposition, large-set, and small-set Shapley tests | **Caught:** 3 failed, exit 1. |
